{
  "id": "7.17c-ac-ai-secrets-cutover",
  "description": "D, step 3 (owner-approved; the diagnosis Lambda is POTENTIALLY IMPACTS S4R): both consumers of the AI-config, OpenAI and Jev secrets switch to applianceclinic/production/{ai-config,openai,jev} together: the diagnosis Lambda reads them, whichpart-api reads them and Settings writes them. Code: the secret ids become environment-overridable (admin-config.js, ai-config.js; defaults unchanged). Environment: AI_CONFIG_SECRET_ID, OPENAI_SECRET_ID, JEV_SECRET_ID. The values are the existing ones (copied in 7.17a); no provider credential is rotated. No fallback to the old ids.",
  "classification": "POTENTIALLY IMPACTS S4R (approved)",
  "stack": "AcRuntimeStack",
  "kind": "UPDATE",
  "expectedChanges": [
