  "grantNotes": "Code and configuration updates of the two consumers; read of the staged phase7 build artefacts in the AC assets bucket (one prefix instead of two exact keys, to stay under the 6,144-character managed-policy limit); PassRole to Lambda on their own AC roles. The read-only base already allows lambda:Get* on AC functions.",
